{"role":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is a concise audit against the **SmartCalendar** single-session panel in `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue` (roughly lines 330–534): modal title **「單堂檢視」**; primary card **「本堂日期」** + value **`（週X）`**; **「上課時間」** for start–end and duration; hint mentioning **「單堂操作（請假／調課／加課）」**; action block title **「單堂操作」**; sections **「課程資料（僅供參考）」**, **「時段與費用」** (when `editingCourseId`), **「繳費狀態（僅供參考）」**.\n\n---\n\n### 1. `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue`\n\n**Section headers / visible labels (template)**\n\n- `UniversalClassScheduler`: `title=\"新增課程（統一排課介面）\"`; `submit-label=\"建立課程\"`.\n- Edit course overlay: **`編輯課程`** (`h3.modal-title`).\n- Link button: **`＋ 單次加課（不增加總堂數）`**.\n- Actions: **`取消`** / **`儲存`** on the edit modal.\n- Other modals (placeholders only here): `LeaveModal`, `RescheduleModal`, `MakeupSlotsModal`, `QuickAddSessionModal`, `SessionEditModal`, etc.\n\n**Embedded form** (`CourseEditForm`): labels such as **`科目`**, **`老師`**, **`開課日`**, **`類型`**, **`單堂費用（元）`** / **`每小時費用（元）`**, **`預設上課時長（小時）`**, **`繳費方式`**, **`固定排課日（可多選）`**, **`剩餘堂數`**, etc. (not duplicated in full here).\n\n**Conflicts vs SmartCalendar single-session terminology**\n\n- **Different job**: this page’s main modal is **whole-course edit** (`編輯課程`), not **「單堂檢視」**—so missing **「課程資料（僅供參考）」 / 「時段與費用」 / 「繳費狀態（僅供參考）」** here is expected unless you intentionally mirror that **sectioning** inside course edit for consistency.\n- **「單次加課」** vs calendar **「加課」**: same idea, different wording.\n- **`開課日`** (CourseEditForm) vs SmartCalendar create block **`首堂上課日期 (First Class Date)`**: two names for the same concept across flows.\n\n**Suggested alignment (optional)**\n\n- If the goal is **cross-page wording** only: consider **`加課`** phrasing aligned with SmartCalendar (e.g. button text closer to **「＋ 加課」** or shared copy).\n- If the goal is **structural parity**: add optional subsection titles in the edit experience (e.g. grouping read-only or “whole course” fields under **「課程資料」**-style labels)—only if product wants course management to echo the calendar modal hierarchy.\n\n---\n\n### 2. `/home/admin/frontend/src/components/UniversalClassScheduler.vue`\n\n**Section headers**\n\n- **`{{ title }}`** (dynamic `h3`).\n- **`欄位設定`** (`h4`).\n- **`固定上課星期`** (`h4`).\n- **`備註`** (`h4`).\n- **`日曆摘要`** (`h4`).\n\n**Representative labels**\n\n- Notes under title about **固定上課星期** / **手動** dates.\n- **`學生 *`**, **`老師 *`**, **`預設科目 *`**, **`上課類型 *`**, **`每小時費用 *` / `單堂費用 *`**, **`繳費方式 *`**, **`購買總堂數 *`**, **`結算日 *`**, **`本月預排堂數 *`**, **`上課教室`**, **`繳費日期（選填）`**, **`預設上課時長（小時） *`**, weekday chips **週一…週日**, summary **手動選定（堂）** / **未來預排（堂）**, etc.\n\n**Conflicts vs SmartCalendar single-session terminology**\n\n- **No `首堂` in this file’s template** (SmartCalendar puts **首堂** in its own inline create form, not in `UniversalClassScheduler`).\n- Vocabulary is **contract / batch scheduling** (**固定上課星期**, **單堂費用**, **日曆摘要**), not **「本堂日期」** or **「單堂操作」**—appropriate for context; only a “conflict” if you want **one glossary** everywhere regardless of screen role.\n\n**Suggested alignment (optional)**\n\n- Usually **none required**: keep **固定上課星期** vs **本堂日期** as **course vs clicked session**.\n- If you unify **fee/duration** section naming with SmartCalendar, you could reuse **「時段與費用」** as a grouped label where both appear together—only if it doesn’t confuse “preset duration” with “this session’s time.”\n\n---\n\n### 3. `/home/admin/frontend/src/components/course-management/SessionEditModal.vue`\n\n**Headers / labels**\n\n- **`單堂課操作`** (`h3.modal-title`) — subtitle: student — subject.\n- Info rows: **`日期`**, **`時段`**, **`老師`**, **`目前狀態`**, optional **`點名時間`**, **`評量`**.\n- **`操作`** (`h4`) — grid of status / **調課** / **換代課老師** / **`備註 / 時段`**, etc.\n- Modes: **`補請假確認`**, **`換代課老師`**, **`調課 — 選擇新時段`** (with **`新日期`**, **`新開始時間`**, **`預計新結束`**), **`備註 / 調整結束時間`**, footer **`+ 新增堂次`**.\n\n**Conflicts vs SmartCalendar**\n\n| SmartCalendar | SessionEditModal | Issue |\n|---------------|------------------|--------|\n| Modal **「單堂檢視」** | **「單堂課操作」** | Title wording differs (**檢視** vs **課操作**); calendar separates **title** from action block **「單堂操作」**. |\n| **「本堂日期」** | **「日期」** | Weaker alignment with **本堂** framing. |\n| **「上課時間」** (range + hours) | **「時段」** (start–end only in row) | Same idea, different label. |\n| Section **「單堂操作」** | Section **「操作」** | Generic vs explicit **單堂**. |\n| (N/A—calendar has course reference blocks) | No **「課程資料（僅供參考）」** / **「時段與費用」** / **「繳費狀態（僅供參考）」** | OK if this modal stays **attendance/session ops** only; inconsistent only if you want the same **three-tier** layout (本堂 → 單堂操作 → 參考資料). |\n\n**Suggested alignment**\n\n- Title: e.g. **「單堂檢視」** to match SmartCalendar, and keep **「單堂操作」** as the `h4` above the button grid (replacing **「操作」**).\n- Rows: **`本堂日期`** instead of **`日期`**; **`上課時間`** (or split label **時段** + subline for hours if you add duration display).\n- Optionally add a **muted “僅供參考”** block if course-level fields are ever shown here (currently they are not).\n\n---\n\n### 4. `/home/admin/frontend/src/components/course-management/QuickAddSessionModal.vue`\n\n**Headers / labels**\n\n- **`加課／補登（不增加總堂數）`** (`h3`).\n- Body hint about moving a future session when slots are full.\n- **`上課日期`**, **`開始時間`**, **`時長（分鐘）`**, **`備註（選填）`**, checkbox **`若該堂已下課，直接補登並扣堂`**, **`取消`** / **`確認送出`**.\n\n**Conflicts vs SmartCalendar**\n\n- **`上課日期`** vs **「本堂日期」** (calendar).\n- Title mixes **加課／補登**; calendar uses **「＋ 加課」** in the action strip—same family, different emphasis (**補登** is extra semantics).\n\n**Suggested alignment**\n\n- **`本堂日期`** if this modal always refers to **one** session date being added/moved.\n- Optional subtitle/hint line echoing SmartCalendar: **「僅可進行單堂操作…」** only if it’s true for this entry path.\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n\n- **Largest terminology gap**: `SessionEditModal.vue` (**「單堂課操作」**, **「日期」**, **「時段」**,